{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110953","id":2865922985,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6q0oOp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110953","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110953.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110953.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110953","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110953/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110953/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110953/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9283328fe70d27f148c403943a283d93a9785beb","number":110953,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix folder sorting in file dialogs for all sort options","user":{"login":"Wayne-Kim","id":75321423,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzIxNDIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75321423?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim","html_url":"https://github.com/Wayne-Kim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# PR Description: Directory Sorting Fixes and Improvements\r\n\r\nThis PR addresses several long-standing issues related to directory sorting within Godot's file dialogs, ensuring more consistent and correct behavior.\r\n\r\n### Key Changes:\r\n\r\n*   **Fixes Directory Sorting Inconsistencies:**\r\n    *   Corrected the issue where `TYPE_REVERSE` sorting was not properly applied to directories.\r\n    *   Resolved the problem where `MODIFIED_TIME` sorting always defaulted to name-based sorting for directories.\r\n    *   Introduced proper, robust modified time-based sorting for directories.\r\n    *   Ensured that all reverse sort options (e.g., `TYPE_REVERSE`, `MODIFIED_TIME` with reverse) now function correctly for directories.\r\n*   **Architectural Enhancements:**\r\n    *   Implemented a new `DirInfo` structure within `EditorFileDialog` to efficiently handle and store necessary information for time-based sorting.\r\n    *   Refactored and cleaned up the overall sorting logic, leading to improved code consistency and maintainability.\r\n\r\n### Issues Addressed:\r\n\r\nPrior to this PR, users experienced the following problems when sorting folders in file dialogs:\r\n\r\n*   When `Type (Descending)` sort was selected, folders were not correctly reversed in their order.\r\n*   Even when `Modified Time` sort was chosen, folders would consistently be sorted by their name instead of their modification timestamp.\r\n*   There was inconsistent sorting behavior observed between the main Editor file dialog and the Scene file dialog.\r\n\r\n### Modified Files:\r\n\r\n*   `scene/gui/file_dialog.cpp`:\r\n    *   Modified to always collect the `modified_time` for directories.\r\n    *   Adjusted reverse sorting conditions to ensure correct application.\r\n*   `editor/gui/editor_file_dialog.cpp`:\r\n    *   Added the new `DirInfo` structure.\r\n    *   Implemented the core logic for time-based directory sorting using the new structure.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <th>AS-IS</th>\r\n    <th>TO-BE</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n